
# Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
# files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

# Folders
# NOTE: never add a bare directory name that exists under src/ or tests/ — it would hide tracked
# source from every .gitignore-aware tool (grep_search, file_search) and silently untrack new files.
# Anchor every pattern to the directory it means instead of relying on unanchored matching.
obj/
artifacts/
bin/
other_mods/
tools/
packages/
scripthookdotnet/
shdn_enhanced/
configs/
doc_images/
LSOL_files/
missions/
graphify-out/

# Compiled folders


# Visual Studio 2015/2017 cache/options directory


# Development files
*.csproj
*.sln


# Copilot-generated files
*.copilot


# Dependency directories


# Images


# Deprecated files
*.old

*.xlsx

# Caveman folders/files
*.agents
*.clinerules
*.cursor
.opencode
.windsurf
skills-lock.json

.github/